// Hand-migrated from legacy/src/test/resources/sample/natural_language_login.flow
// to v3. The original was already prose; the migration removes the trailing
// `with xpath:…` / `with id:…` locator suffixes (REQ-LANG-4) and turns the
// "Verify … appears" sentences into expectations.

story: Login with natural language format
inputs: email: string = "connected2atul@gmail.com", password: secret
  Click the sign in button
  Type {input.email} into the username field
  Type {input.password} into the password field
  Click the login button
  The schedule heading should be visible

story: Logout with natural language format
  Click the logout link
  The home heading should be visible

story: Validate text with natural language format
  Type {data.user.email} into the username field
  Type {data.user.password} into the password field
  Click the login button
  Click the Schedule Build link
  The schedule heading should contain "Enterprise"

compose: Login stories
  Login with natural language format
  Logout with natural language format
  Validate text with natural language format

test: Run all login stories
  Login stories
